<title>RUSSIA: Rouble higher at 3,535 per mark in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble higher at 3,535 per mark in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble rose to 3,535.00 to the German mark on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 3,542.99 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 18		  Oct 17</p>
<p> Mark rate			3,535.00		3,542.99</p>
<p> Volume traded (million DEM)    1.83		    2.01</p>
<p>-- Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
